  "mechanisms": {
    "PASSIVE": "Independent six-stack breath resets each round. A real nearby defender evasion gives an owned two-second opening that reveals that enemy. Only a connected Q/W/R knife hit consumes that caster opening, at most once per cast; basic and derived damage do not consume it.",
    "Q": "One frontal 120-degree radius-three arc after 0.2s startup. Both water and fire cost one breath. Fire deals higher physical damage but gives two-second movement burden, -8% per stack up to three. Actual stance selects ice/wind or fire VFX.",
    "W": "Forward collision-safe movement up to three units after 0.15s startup, damaging each encountered enemy once. Costs one breath.",
    "E": "Three-second breathing restores at a base half-second rate, with an additional payout after real continuous stillness and no recent connected damage. Movement, HP damage and shield damage lower recovery. Six-stack cap, expiry, death and round reset are tested; no extra mana restoration.",
    "R": "One frontal slash after interruptible 0.65s startup. Three breath and ordinary mana/cooldown are reserved on cast; interruption does not refund. Resolved slash adds burden.",
    "EX": "Free water/fire toggle preserves the actual Q instance, cooldown, mana, breath and old burden. Round reset returns to water."
  },
